{"ID":"20240515131355-s8j2e9r","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131355-s8j2e9r","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131355-s8j2e9r\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515142336-heu0cv8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515142336-heu0cv8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:300,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515142336-heu0cv8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:371,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:371\u0026#125;","title":"089","type":"doc","updated":"20240515181424"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515142336-heu0cv8","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 722px;","id":"20240515142336-heu0cv8","updated":"20240515181424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/08/06"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"MM"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"M"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"體重175磅 身高5’9’ 六十歲"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/06"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一週半前切片發現直腸癌。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"１大便稀，同時吃西藥通便。有時鮮血混合大便，有時純血出來。喝可樂，吃麥當勞則便秘或下利。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"２肛門出血，一週前上了（切片之前即出血）"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"３小便淺黃 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"４雙足冷"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"５胃口好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"６口渴有，冷飲"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"７睡皆好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈緩有力"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"舌淡黃紅"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診 :"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"特殊診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"手冷，皮潤。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"耳診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 腸中寒熱並結。醫囑停止任何油炸食物，此為病因。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"針灸處方： "}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮附子五錢　黃連二錢　黃芩三錢　黃柏三錢　麻子仁三錢　"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大黃三錢　丹皮三錢　茜草三錢　"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拾付　"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九碗煮三碗水　"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚飯前各一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.茜草入血分故用，桃仁入氣分。大黃攻堅。 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.他之前有出血，雖然現在血止了，但仍要用活血藥活血化瘀。 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.他喜歡吃油炸食物，體內有溼熱故用三黃瀉心湯。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}